name=Backyard Birds
id=BackyardBirds
description=Wild Kentucky birds visit the vanilla bird bath. They land one at a time, drink, splash, sing, and leave when you get too close. <LINE> <LINE> 
description=<H2> How it works <LINE> <TEXT> 
description=- Birds come in the morning and the evening. Night, rain and frozen water mean no birds. Hot days and fresh rain bring more. <LINE> 
description=- Walk up and they scatter. Sneak to get closer. Zombies scare them too. <LINE> 
description=- A visit lifts boredom and unhappiness a little, at most once an hour. <LINE> <LINE> 
description=<H2> Who comes by <LINE> <TEXT> 
description=Northern Cardinal, Blue Jay, Carolina Chickadee, American Robin, American Goldfinch and, rarely, an Eastern Bluebird. <LINE> <LINE> 
description=Safe to add or remove. The mod adds no items or tiles and saves nothing. Multiplayer needs it on the server and every player.
